{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01F7kcyinHxHdUX6xznL9Xnf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 15 tests pass, including all 7 new tests for recursive traversal and symlink handling. All differential tests match the GNU `gchgrp` reference binary.\n\nSummary of changes:\n\n**`cmd/chgrp/main.go`** — Added recursive traversal (R2.1), symlink dereference control (R2.2), and -H/-L/-P traversal flags (R2.3):\n- Added `symlinkMode` type with `symlinkP`/`symlinkH`/`symlinkL` constants\n- Extended `options` struct with `recursive`, `noDereference`, `symlink` fields\n- Replaced single `changeGroup` with dispatch to `chownSingle` (non-recursive) or `chownRecursive` (recursive walk via `os.ReadDir`)\n- Non-recursive default changed from `Lchown` to `Chown` (follow symlinks), with `Lchown` used when `-h` is set\n- Recursive mode uses `Lchown` by default (-P), `Chown` only with `-L`\n- `-H` follows command-line symlinks for traversal but uses `Lchown` for modification\n- Added flag parsing for `-R`, `-h`, `-H`, `-L`, `-P`, `--recursive`, `--dereference`, `--no-dereference`, `--preserve-root`/`--no-preserve-root`\n\n**`cmd/chgrp/chgrp_test.go`** — Added 7 differential tests covering all R2 requirements plus `setGroupRecursive` helper."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1509,"cache_read_input_tokens":76552,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1509},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3bfc0ed3-e106-4eb1-8ca5-c42dd61ac9de","uuid":"2057e52a-cec9-4d68-9575-39a29df02141"}
